  "description": "<p>For 4 generations All About Fabrics, a division of Phoenix of Anderson, has been serving customers in the textile industry. Our business has evolved from peddling fabric in Russia, to now not only a wholesale company, but also exporting and retail!&nbsp; From large wholesale orders, to orders as small as one yard, we strive to set ourselves apart from the rest.</p>\r\n<p>For 20 years we have been serving the public with our monthly sales. Our retail store is over 40,000 square feet filled with not just fabric but supplies, home decor, and so much more to meet the needs of the avid fabric shopper. For every order purchased, we cut an additional 4 to 6\" per yard to ensure that you are never shorted!</p>\r\n<p>We purchase textiles directly from mills andmanufacturersall throughout the United States. Our inventory is ever changing and added to frequently.As times are ever changing in the world and industry, we have decided to open our eCommerce store, where customers from all over the world can shop our products 24 hours a day, 7 days a week.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>As a family owned business, we strive to meet the needs of our customers and shopping online has been highly requested from our frequent shoppers. We have built our foundation on our integrity, honesty, and competitive prices. We are excited to serve you in a new way and look forward to your feedback!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>",
